  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jollof rice starts with a deep "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tomato base",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tomato-base"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that the rice absorbs as it cooks. The result is red-stained grains with concentrated flavour. Aim for the coveted "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "party jollof",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "party-jollof"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " effect by finishing uncovered over high heat for the final few minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Wash the rice thoroughly until the water runs clear. This removes surface starch and stops the grains clumping."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
